  "solution": "**Given : **21 × 3 − 10 + 4 ÷ 7 = 5\n\nOption 1 : 21 and 4\n\nwhen we interchange equation becomes\n\n__\n \n• **4 × 3 **− 10 + **21 ÷ 7** = 5\n \n• **12 **- 10 **+ 3**__ = 5\n \n• __**15 - 10**__ = 5\n \n• **5 = 5 **\n\n \n\nOption 2 : 4 and 7\n\nwhen we interchange equation becomes\n\n__\n \n• **21 × 3 **− 10 + **7 ÷ 4** = 5\n \n• **63 **- 10** + 1.75__** = 5\n \n• __**64.75 - 10**__ = 5\n \n• 54.75 ≠ 5\n\n \n\nOption 3 : 21 and 3\n\nwhen we interchange equation becomes\n\n__\n \n• 3 × 21 − 10 + **4 ÷ 7 **= 5\n \n• **63 **- 10** + 0.57__** = 5\n \n• __**63.57 - 10**__ = 5\n \n• 53.57 ≠ 5\n\n \n\nOption 4 : 3 and 7\n\nwhen we interchange equation becomes\n\n__\n \n• **21 × 7** − 10 + **4 ÷ 3** = 5\n \n• **147 **- 10 **+ 1.33 __**= 5\n \n• __**148.33 - 10**__ = 5\n \n• 138.33 ≠ 5\n\nHence,** Option 1)** is the correct answer.",
